{"data":{"featured":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Engineering Masters' Thesis","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/CianOC/static/92f09cf32dbd1ec3d09ecd447d1d3f9f/5c157/Thesis.png","srcSet":"/CianOC/static/92f09cf32dbd1ec3d09ecd447d1d3f9f/55b21/Thesis.png 175w,\n/CianOC/static/92f09cf32dbd1ec3d09ecd447d1d3f9f/58b33/Thesis.png 350w,\n/CianOC/static/92f09cf32dbd1ec3d09ecd447d1d3f9f/5c157/Thesis.png 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/CianOC/static/92f09cf32dbd1ec3d09ecd447d1d3f9f/0ee70/Thesis.avif 175w,\n/CianOC/static/92f09cf32dbd1ec3d09ecd447d1d3f9f/fbdeb/Thesis.avif 350w,\n/CianOC/static/92f09cf32dbd1ec3d09ecd447d1d3f9f/315d4/Thesis.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/CianOC/static/92f09cf32dbd1ec3d09ecd447d1d3f9f/8ed27/Thesis.webp 175w,\n/CianOC/static/92f09cf32dbd1ec3d09ecd447d1d3f9f/ba031/Thesis.webp 350w,\n/CianOC/static/92f09cf32dbd1ec3d09ecd447d1d3f9f/7fafe/Thesis.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":753}}},"tech":["Machine Learning","Structural Dynamics","Supervised / Unsupervised ML Models","Structural Health Monitoring"],"github":null,"external":null,"cta":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1E8ttCLNVWVM2Owsu6jBxkDcxytGAO7BC/view?usp=drive_link"},"html":"<p>My final year Masters' thesis titled - 'Developing Machine Learning Damage Detection Algorithms for\nStructural Health Monitoring of a Real Bridge'. Successfully detected progressive damage on a real\nbridge using accelerometer data attached to a recently decommisioned bridge. Developed novel techniques\nto improve research in the field of structural health monitoring. Received an A grade for this thesis : )</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"AI in the Road Sector Research Report","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/CianOC/static/be7bccf49481f98c5b861249ef78b5db/4c727/PIARC.png","srcSet":"/CianOC/static/be7bccf49481f98c5b861249ef78b5db/8ce61/PIARC.png 146w,\n/CianOC/static/be7bccf49481f98c5b861249ef78b5db/fac82/PIARC.png 292w,\n/CianOC/static/be7bccf49481f98c5b861249ef78b5db/4c727/PIARC.png 583w","sizes":"(min-width: 583px) 583px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/CianOC/static/be7bccf49481f98c5b861249ef78b5db/1784b/PIARC.avif 146w,\n/CianOC/static/be7bccf49481f98c5b861249ef78b5db/b6b2f/PIARC.avif 292w,\n/CianOC/static/be7bccf49481f98c5b861249ef78b5db/35e0f/PIARC.avif 583w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 583px) 583px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/CianOC/static/be7bccf49481f98c5b861249ef78b5db/2c1f1/PIARC.webp 146w,\n/CianOC/static/be7bccf49481f98c5b861249ef78b5db/edbcc/PIARC.webp 292w,\n/CianOC/static/be7bccf49481f98c5b861249ef78b5db/b5d32/PIARC.webp 583w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 583px) 583px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":679.5883361921098}}},"tech":["Artifical Intelligence","Research","Stakeholder Engagement","Technology in Transport"],"github":null,"external":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1j1gXLfOXUfiVTIs_pqjyDfbwMFjkSYR2/view?usp=drive_link","cta":"https://www.piarc.org/en/order-library/46418-en-Artificial%20Intelligence%20in%20the%20Road%20Sector"},"html":"<p>I was involved in a conducting a research report on 'AI in the Road Sector' during my time on work placement at Roughan &#x26; O'Donovan. This work was done on behalf of PIARC (World Road Association), with the aim of informing road authorities around the world of the future outlook of AI in the industry. The report covers a wide range of applications, with my work including literature review, stakeholder engagement and finalising drafts of the report. This work gained significant global traction, a preview of the report can be found <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1j1gXLfOXUfiVTIs_pqjyDfbwMFjkSYR2/view?usp=drive_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">here</a>, and the full report can be found <a href=\"https://www.piarc.org/en/order-library/46418-en-Artificial%20Intelligence%20in%20the%20Road%20Sector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">here</a> on the PIARC website.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Masters' Research Paper","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/CianOC/static/e5f87effc6cc86d3dad8a5b04bef1255/46a1d/Cover-Page-Research-Paper-1.png","srcSet":"/CianOC/static/e5f87effc6cc86d3dad8a5b04bef1255/976f4/Cover-Page-Research-Paper-1.png 175w,\n/CianOC/static/e5f87effc6cc86d3dad8a5b04bef1255/95e90/Cover-Page-Research-Paper-1.png 350w,\n/CianOC/static/e5f87effc6cc86d3dad8a5b04bef1255/46a1d/Cover-Page-Research-Paper-1.png 700w,\n/CianOC/static/e5f87effc6cc86d3dad8a5b04bef1255/3e5b4/Cover-Page-Research-Paper-1.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/CianOC/static/e5f87effc6cc86d3dad8a5b04bef1255/0aa7f/Cover-Page-Research-Paper-1.avif 175w,\n/CianOC/static/e5f87effc6cc86d3dad8a5b04bef1255/72422/Cover-Page-Research-Paper-1.avif 350w,\n/CianOC/static/e5f87effc6cc86d3dad8a5b04bef1255/4256e/Cover-Page-Research-Paper-1.avif 700w,\n/CianOC/static/e5f87effc6cc86d3dad8a5b04bef1255/ccb83/Cover-Page-Research-Paper-1.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/CianOC/static/e5f87effc6cc86d3dad8a5b04bef1255/3f620/Cover-Page-Research-Paper-1.webp 175w,\n/CianOC/static/e5f87effc6cc86d3dad8a5b04bef1255/6e8c7/Cover-Page-Research-Paper-1.webp 350w,\n/CianOC/static/e5f87effc6cc86d3dad8a5b04bef1255/246fb/Cover-Page-Research-Paper-1.webp 700w,\n/CianOC/static/e5f87effc6cc86d3dad8a5b04bef1255/8eea4/Cover-Page-Research-Paper-1.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":542}}},"tech":["Unsupervised ML","Deep Autoencoder","Structural Health Monitoring","Report writing"],"github":null,"external":null,"cta":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1z5dwtX48A45Fl2Fw2_erwWLwlD97OsSS/view?usp=drive_link"},"html":"<p>During my work on my final year project in college I developed a novel deep autoencoder approach for damage detection on a real bridge. This work significantly contributes to the field of structural health monitoring in that the ML model was successfully able to detect progressive damage on this real bridge. Typically, these studies are conducted in idealised laboratory environments or through numerical simulations, however this study highlights the capability of using machine learning to detect damage in a real bridge when noise present in the data is accounted for correctly. Hopefully someday this gets published in an academic journal!</p>"}}]}}}